    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 87 St. Anne’s Square is a superbly renovated three-bedroom mid-terrace home, where a complete transformation has created a stylish, modern and highly energy-efficient residence in the heart of Portmarnock. \r\n\r\nFrom the moment you step inside, the quality of the renovation is immediately apparent. The welcoming entrance hall leads to a bright and comfortable lounge, while to the rear lies the heart of the home a beautifully appointed open-plan kitchen and dining space, thoughtfully designed for modern living and entertaining. Double doors open seamlessly onto the landscaped rear garden, creating a wonderful connection between the indoor and outdoor living spaces. Upstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms and a contemporary family bathroom, with the entire home presented in excellent condition throughout.\r\n\r\nIdeally positioned close to Portmarnock Village, excellent schools, local amenities, the DART and the beautiful Velvet Strand, No. 87 is a turnkey home of exceptional quality and represents a fantastic opportunity to acquire a fully renovated property in one of North County Dublin’s most sought-after locations.\r\n\r\nFor further information contact Darren Kelly or Liam Foley on 01 8462752."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall\t 4.15 x 1.87\tTiled floor, light fitting\r\n\r\nLounge\t3.96 x 3.71\tTiled floor, light fitting, overlooking green space\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining room\t5.30 x 4.35\tTiled floor, oven, hob, extractor fan, fitted kitchen units, dishwasher, understair storage, 2 x velux windows, double doors to rear garden, spotlights, light fitting, fitted units\r\n\r\nStairs / landing\t\tCarpet floor, pull down ladder access to attic\r\n\t\t\r\nFamily Bathroom\t1.60 x 2.09\tTiled floor & walls, heated rail, wc, whb, walk in shower with handheld shower head & feature overhanging shower head\r\n\r\nBedroom 1       3.49 x 2.85  \tDecorative timber floor, light fitting\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\t3.22 x 3.93\tDecorative timber floor, light fitting\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\t2.89 x 2.39\tDecorative timber floor, light fitting\r\n\r\nRear Garden    Landscaped, part patio, part lawn, fully fenced"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tGas Fired Central Heating\r\n•\tFully refurbished\r\n•\tClose to all amenities \r\n•\tFamily Friendly Estate\r\n•\tSuperb Location\r\n•\tOff Street Parking"
      },
